  {
   "id": "appendix-quick-reference-md-9",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "### Capabilities ([Capabilities](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/capabilities.html))\n\nCapability calls are dotted and have **no `@`**. They exist only if you enabled\nthem:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
